WEBVTT

00:00:59.276 --> 00:01:02.196
such a nonpartnerish thing to do.

00:01:02.196 --> 00:01:06.676
But that very afternoon
I up and left my law firm for good.

00:01:06.716 --> 00:01:09.716
And a few weeks after that
ended a seven-year relationship

00:01:09.756 --> 00:01:11.516
that had always felt wrong.

00:01:11.556 --> 00:01:13.876
And so, now I was in my early 30s,

00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:15.956
and suddenly I had no career,

00:01:15.996 --> 00:01:18.236
no love, no place to live.

00:01:18.236 --> 00:01:20.956
And immediately,
I fell into a relationship

00:01:20.996 --> 00:01:22.756
with a handsome musician

00:01:22.796 --> 00:01:25.476
who liked to compose lyrics by day

00:01:25.516 --> 00:01:29.156
and stand around a piano
with friends, singing, at night.

00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:32.036
And he was the wrong guy
for various reasons,